  "partial_reason": "Relation authoring, targeted evidence verification, independent seed/relation review, reusable-cache construction (V1), Build-12-with-cache replay, Transfer-12 selection and everything downstream of it, and any conditional generation all require either newly identifiable candidates this session's discovery could not safely name from metadata (6 of 8 opportunities) or the same full-session, one-candidate-at-a-time clinical-authoring depth this file already required for every comparable prior slice of this exact pipeline. Compressing them here would be materially less scrutiny of safety-critical medical/legal content than this project's own established practice requires, which this project has already had to diagnose and repair once (Fresh-Holdout-24 contamination). Reported PARTIAL_QUOTA_INTERRUPTION, not fabricated.",
